<title>USA: Invacare names Blouch president, COO.</title>
<headline>Invacare names Blouch president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>ELYRIA, Ohio 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invacare Corp said Tuesday it is appointing Gerald Blouch as president. The post was held by the company's chairman and chief executive, A. Malachi Mixon III, Invacare said.</p>
<p>Blouch was president of the company's home care division and later gained responsibility for its international division. He will oversee company operations and business units worldwide as president, Invacare said.</p>
<p>Invacare makes and distributes home medical equipment for the disabled.</p>
</text>
